{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_title", "source_sha256": "a43e0025a1172dd9e11df943c2df19ea29c036d64a0f01d9d386524c51eca25c", "ja": "だから自分はここにいる", "zh": "所以我才在这里", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_synopsis", "source_sha256": "629d6eb65b0d8e7b21927cca01b2a4f150950fb382817030f19c9d5eb51df70e", "ja": "新鋭の芸能事務所にスカウトされた響。ダン\nスで世界のトップを目指せると聞き心が揺れ\n動き、そんな己を恥じる。しかしプロデュー\nサーや仲間の言葉で、改めてここが自分の\n居場所だと再認識するのだった。", "zh": "响被新锐演艺事务所挖角。听说能凭借舞蹈\n问鼎世界顶峰，她的内心不禁动摇，并为此感到\n羞愧。但在制作人和同伴的话语中，她再次\n坚信，这里才是属于自己的容身之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1000_null", "source_sha256": "3c17c013455d2d4cd88b59c82c984e84680d19f4ac0762a1390f6f040dceae5c", "ja": "公演翌日……", "zh": "公演次日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "00662c9efba9f7af6d03df821225e6e3d1eb2c3390ddd29725d9ead4828809c1", "ja": "すごかったね！　昨日の公演、\nまだ興奮が体に残ってる感じだよ。", "zh": "太厉害了！昨天的公演，兴奋的感觉还残留在身体里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "807e5c15962d6f7f9bdf7c50e6c79bf8bf6b93542f104d7ea24ceb40f72f81fc", "ja": "我那覇さんのポテンシャルを見せつけられました。\n恐ろしいほどの頼もしさ……。憧れるぞ。", "zh": "见识到了我那霸小姐的潜力。可靠得令人害怕……真让人憧憬啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "bfd472dca7ddfac67f98fd95878c27b56418d29169500eae10376b29629ef4e7", "ja": "ネットでも、すごい……\nバズって、ます……。", "zh": "在网上也，好厉害……\n都火起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "87bb0559917d00203a2174d0a4576420059bfdbff623750d6b712c95740bca59", "ja": "そうそう！　リリースの時から曲を知ってる人も、\n初めての人も、みんな喜んでくれてるよね～！", "zh": "对对！从发布之初就知道这首歌的人，还有第一次听到的人，大家都很开心呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "c9822a188a7180d9103f284d554579511a688fec7243dc42a6b045bb748eec8c", "ja": "今の自分の全部を出し切れたって感じだから。\nえへへ、みんな、ホントにありがとねっ！", "zh": "因为感觉自己把现在的全部都发挥出来了。\n嘿嘿，真的谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3d65c18873df10bad5ea62aa673338e45bc2a99e04b3a94e8a0796cbf214cfe3", "ja": "あれ、今日のレッスン、このメンバーだったか。\nまるでまだ公演前みたいだな。", "zh": "咦，今天参加练习的是这些成员啊。\n简直就像还没开始公演一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "1fa1454439f1ce06628222b637e45e1f09f876579b047b4a6545efd74407b23d", "ja": "昨日の公演の反省会をしようって話になったんです。\nでも時間前に集まってるなんて、感心ね。", "zh": "是说要开昨天公演的总结会。\n不过能提前集合，真让人欣慰呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "58b2fe911c11d0e4cb9ff85a42b3c70d3ea88898c680b7d304cdea003fcfbc16", "ja": "響、昨日のステージ、春香たちも驚いてたわよ。\n千早なんか、かなり刺激を受けてたみたい。", "zh": "响，昨天的舞台连春香她们都吓了一跳呢。千早好像也受到了相当大的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "12e7c1187de4131d78b7ecbe7492ee393ee7373d9d2a0b5f88e5baf29133b5e2", "ja": "千早が？　……ふーん、ま、いいけどねっ。\n自分はこれからも、誰にも負けないさー！", "zh": "千早？……嗯，随便啦。\n我今后也不会输给任何人的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "224e8e84687e7a2db681fc0696dc4fec19635a021bf6aa315d463816f398d34f", "ja": "それじゃみんな！　そろそろ反省会、始めよっか！", "zh": "那么大家！差不多该开始复盘会了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "214e601c37b86670dbb769c9d717a745556153aba7608860c12ff922ff662af6", "ja": "……{$P$}。\nそういえばなんですけど。", "zh": "……{$P$}。\n说起来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "1ddc9c26de9b6b1253d62548acb363b15aabf8b0ad69f78ca359fd9c462ef26b", "ja": "『パンドラステージ』って新鋭の事務所が、\n響の引き抜きに動いてたって、知ってたんですか？", "zh": "你知道吗，有一家名为“潘多拉舞台”的新兴事务所，曾经想挖走响吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b09bdc27abc5da9b009544ff93a9cec2b92683d722961fce7dec531809cae82c", "ja": "うーん……響なら、よその事務所が欲しいと\n思うのも当たり前だからなぁ。", "zh": "嗯……毕竟是响嘛，别的事务所想把她挖走也是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1015_p", "source_sha256": "610c12dc5038bf9f427ee15a47dd12773dc6ce087687d78c728ae4548653d038", "ja": "もちろん、他の子たちもだけど。\nそういうのはよくある話だから。", "zh": "当然，其他孩子也一样。不过，这种事很常见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1016_p", "source_sha256": "aebab4e5d9d22fd7050390e0c04301fb5fa241fd831ab8c3cb6d141553b76d3a", "ja": "まあ、本人の選択に任せるしかないけど、\nウチに残ってくれたら……。", "zh": "不过，终究只能由本人来选择。\n但要是愿意留下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1bdaa0099415abaf9353e57b696d5091abddb2671c188761b299c8df8a93119d", "ja": "どこにいるよりも、誰よりも輝かせてみせる。\n……約束するよ。", "zh": "我一定会让她比身处任何地方、比任何人都更加闪耀。\n……我保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "2ad268aa6dcca8b29356557fbc69c94db932a7fbd38786fb1b3bcdccfc3a5d25", "ja": "……ふふっ、言いますね。\nま、そういう覚悟、伝わってるのかもしれませんけど。", "zh": "……呵呵，还真敢说呢。\n不过，或许正是因为这种觉悟已经传达给我了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "76a6378ac351fa8ed20b00d1e9f583f3bbdf5421f9b1bfd4ff417877f5908d00", "ja": "……そこのところなんだけど、\nもっとこうしてもよかったって思うんだ！", "zh": "……关于这点，\n我觉得还可以再这么做一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "cb9ce52d5fbacbab4f2637ccb3758d4f68708e8f22279592ad3d4c8544675f8c", "ja": "あっ、そうかも！　じゃあ、こんな感じ！？", "zh": "啊，说得也是！那就像这样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d403d7b1355535f273ba47284e40296169911460fa17da4bb5c8c35b923bdc2", "ja": "そうそう！\nだから今度やる時があったらさ～。", "zh": "对对！\n所以，下次要是还有机会的话～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1022_p", "source_sha256": "03da3df3620b6ec3aeb159f397fe15861ac426b4fe9584ba18cba9b703c5a0b8", "ja": "……響、本番明けだから、ほどほどになー。", "zh": "……响，刚结束正式演出，别太勉强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "ebdc975b67002ce5c1159f88c80e54d145db8867a0e00b9dab51ba0467546632", "ja": "平気平気、わかってるさー！\n体調管理もカンペキにしないとねっ。", "zh": "没事没事，我心里有数啦！\n身体状态的管理也必须要做到完美才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_148_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "8ecb4df34d8d74804ce181e0c4dda7c42a44919b72d7f29b96d29897e66edfc5", "ja": "トップアイドルへ続く道は、これからが本番だから！\nあっはははは！", "zh": "通往顶级偶像的道路，现在才是真正的开始！\n啊哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
